# Deploy target: RimWorld - Dev

When deploying any mod from this repo to a local RimWorld install:

1. **Always** deploy to:
   `E:\SteamLibrary\steamapps\common\RimWorld - Dev\Mods\<ModFolder>`
2. Also deploy to the non-Dev install when useful / when the user asks for “the RimWorld mods folder”:
   `E:\SteamLibrary\steamapps\common\RimWorld\Mods\<ModFolder>`
3. If C# changed, **rebuild the DLL first**, then copy so the deployed assembly matches the branch.
4. Prefer a runtime pack (About, Assemblies, Defs, Languages, Textures, Patches, LoadFolders, etc.). Skip `Source`, `Tools`, `ArtPackage`, and other non-runtime trees unless the user asks otherwise.
5. If a DLL copy fails because the file is locked (“user-mapped section open”), tell the user to close RimWorld (or the Dev instance) and retry — do not silently leave a stale DLL.
